### 1. Root route
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. GET all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### 3. GET single book by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

### 4. POST add a new book
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 650,
  "pages": 464
}

### 5. PUT update existing book
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby (Collector's Edition)",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "price": 599,
  "pages": 195
}

### 6. DELETE book by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/11/

### 7. GET non-existent book (404 test)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999/
